			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				66,
				1
			],
			"Message": "feat(Maintain): Add recursive JSON array deduplication in build script\n\nThe `JsonEdit` function in `Source/Build/JsonEdit.rs` previously risked appending duplicate sidecar paths to the `bundle.binaries` array during repeated execution. Enhance the logic to first check for existing sidecar entries before insertion.\n\nImplement a new `DedupeJson` helper function that recursively traverses the entire JSON document. This function removes duplicate values from all arrays (preserving the first occurrence) and descends into nested objects and arrays. This ensures idempotency for the build process, preventing duplicate entries introduced by upstream changes or prior partial runs without altering array order.\n\nThe `Modified` flag is now updated if any duplicates are removed, ensuring the JSON file is only rewritten when content actually changes.",
			"SHA": "cb147412bf12a6033e55281dca234f5b4d45178e"
		}
	],
